From 3110ea7b2434b3f4a6d11cc813fc23b5caef1ba0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jessiewei7 <jessiewei747@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 03:21:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(pd): make DSV4 retraction safe

Restore supported non-speculative DSV4 requests through HiCache
sidecars. Abort unsupported speculative state per request instead of
crashing the decode scheduler.

Refs #33385

Signed-off-by: jessiewei7 <jessiewei747@gmail.com>
